{
    "id": "postman-parts",
    "title": "用部件图装的邮差纸偶",
    "asks": ["story", "film", "characters"],
    "prompt": "assets 里有一张邮差的部件图（postman-parts.png）和一张他的全身参考图（postman-reference.png），用它们做角色，做一条 30 秒的短片：邮差送完了一天的信，包里却还剩一封。",
    "workspace": {
        "assets/postman-parts.png": {
            "generator": "repo",
            "from": "examples/postman-print/assets/postman-parts.png"
        },
        "assets/postman-reference.png": {
            "generator": "repo",
            "from": "examples/postman-print/assets/postman-reference.png"
        },
        "assets/SOURCES.json": {
            "generator": "copy",
            "from": "files/SOURCES.json"
        }
    },
    "timeoutMin": 45,
    "expect": {
        "durationSec": [28.5, 31.5],
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 1080,
        "audio": "score",
        "uses": ["loadRig(", "puppet("],
        "files": ["assets/puppets/*/rig.json"],
        "review": [
            "装好的纸偶和参考图是同一个人，比例对，零件没有装反",
            "关节藏在上一节下面，没有露出圆片、断口或描边圈",
            "走路时着地的脚不打滑，停下时收脚站稳",
            "剩下那封信的去向就是故事的落点，画面上看得出来"
        ]
    }
}
